{'symbol': 'UPS', 'date': '2022-04-26 06:00:00', 'title': 'UPS RELEASES 1Q 2022 EARNINGS', 'text': 'ATLANTA, APRIL 26, 2022 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- \xa0UPS (NYSE:UPS) TODAY ANNOUNCED FIRST-QUARTER 2022 CONSOLIDATED REVENUE OF $24.4 BILLION, A 6.4% INCREASE OVER THE FIRST QUARTER OF 2021. CONSOLIDATED OPERATING PROFIT WAS $3.3 BILLION, UP 17.6% COMPARED TO THE FIRST QUARTER OF 2021, AND UP 12.1% ON AN ADJUSTED BASIS. DILUTED EARNINGS PER SHARE WERE $3.03 FOR THE QUARTER; ADJUSTED DILUTED EARNINGS PER SHARE OF $3.05 WERE 10.1% ABOVE THE SAME PERIOD IN 2021.'}